{"id":"2ab9485c68bf8ab2","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition.md","title":"Lebesgue Decomposition","display":"prop-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition","aliases":["58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition"],"display":"prop-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]","[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity]]","[[58-df-singular-measures]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" href=\"?note=fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity\">../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7d817d22ccbf755\" href=\"?note=f7d817d22ccbf755\" title=\"58-df-singular-measures\">58-df-singular-measures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (measurable space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\nu\">\\(\\mu,\\nu\\)</span> (sigma-finite measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\)</span> (sigma-finiteness predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S\\)</span> (mutual-singularity predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S\\)</span> (absolute-continuity predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\nu)\n\\to \\exists!q\\;\\exists\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\;\\Bigl(\nq=\\langle\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=\\nu_a(A)+\\nu_s(A)\\bigr)\n\\land \\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\nu)\n\\to \\exists!q\\;\\exists\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\;\\Bigl(\nq=\\langle\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=\\nu_a(A)+\\nu_s(A)\\bigr)\n\\land \\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under sigma-finiteness, the absolutely continuous and singular components exist and are unique as an ordered pair.</li>\n<li>Equality with the sum measure is expanded pointwise on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>; no undeclared measure-addition operation is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-singular-measures","status":"resolved","id":"f7d817d22ccbf755","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular-measures]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\nu)\n\\to \\exists!q\\;\\exists\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\;\\Bigl(\nq=\\langle\\nu_a,\\nu_s\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\bigl(\\nu(A)=\\nu_a(A)+\\nu_s(A)\\bigr)\n\\land \\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land \\mathrm{MutuallySingular}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false}],"bytes":1726,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3975","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition.md|58-prop-lebesgue-decomposition]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","f7d817d22ccbf755","ad78f775172312be"]}